	•	Section 4 Comments/Quotes: Missing-data handling was not described for model inputs. Class imbalance was addressed at least in part because the hyperparameter search included “class weights.” Preprocessing was described: ECGs were digital 12-lead recordings at 500 Hz, and the model input was a “12 by 5000 array,” with random noise and translation layers. The paper does not report code release. The training and test sets contained “6074/758 unique ECG-biopsy pairs,” respectively.  ￼

